        "original_id": "0b303dbb-5565-5ff2-8eb9-4a40b4c58ceb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Ezhou, Quzhou, Beijing, Hubei Province, Zhejiang Province, China\n- People: Trần Ích Tắc\n- Organizations: Yuan Dynasty\n- Roles: prefecture-level city, King of Annam\n- Venues: Xiannongtan Stadium\n\nFacts:\n- Ezhou is a prefecture-level city in eastern Hubei Province, China.\n- Quzhou is a prefecture-level city in western Zhejiang Province, People's Republic of China.\n- After another failed attempt by the Yuan Dynasty to restore Trần Ích Tắc as King of Annam, Trần Ích Tắc continued to live in Ezhou, Hubei.\n- Trần Ích Tắc ultimately died on foreign soil.\n- Xiannongtan Stadium is a multi-use stadium in Beijing, China.",
